plot follows Jesus who's just  been released from jail after he was  framed for a crime he didn't commit  now a free man he teams up with two  friends and goes on a wild road trip  according to the film's official plot  synopsis the movie is a film about a  trio of misfits whose irreverent  sexually-charged - dynamic evolves into  a surprising love story as they're  spontaneous and flippant attitude  towards the past or future backfires  time and again even as they  inadvertently perform good deeds in  September 2019 a trailer for the Jesus  rolls appeared albeit one dubbed an  Italian to promote the film's release in  Italy as for the dynamic directing duo  the Cohens aren't involved with this  spin-off sequel but they're still  totally cool with Totoro making a part -  almost two decades after the first face  jam mashed up live-action comedy Looney  Tunes animation and professional  basketball Warner Brothers announced in  early 2014 but they'd be making a follow  up to the 1996 film the original Space  Jam starred NBA superstar Michael Jordan  and featured appearances from a number  of other NBA players alongside its  animated cast the sequel will star NBA  MVP LeBron James  addition to don cheadle fresh off his  almost decade-long stint in the Marvel  Cinematic Universe with a production  team that includes Black Panthers Ryan  Coogler  and The Fast and the Furious series  Justin Lin Space Jam 2 will be helmed by  director Malcolm D Lee Lee wasn't the  first director attached to the film  though he stepped in for Terrence Nance  who departed the production on good  terms in july 2019 citing creative  differences the film is set to hit  theaters on July 16 2021 almost a full  quarter of a century after the first  film premiered check out one of our  newest videos right here plus even more  looper videos about your favorite movies  are coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]
 

